  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Financiamiento de estrategias de bajo carbono en reas forestales</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing Low Carbon Strategies in Forest Landscapes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo es crear una linea de financiamiento accesible a comunidades y ejidos para financiar actividades de bajo carbono en areas forestales, para mitigar una de las causantes de deforestacin. La linea de credito ser ofrecida por Financiera Rural.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project objective is to create dedicated financing line accessible by communities and ejidos to finance low carbon activities in forest landscapes, addressing one of the drivers of deforestation. The credit line will be provided by Financiera Rural, a public financial institution focused on rural development.</narrative>
  </description>
